1
00:00:00,056 --> 00:00:01,986
(Beverly:)is difficult to ignore.

2
00:00:01,992 --> 00:00:03,392
AMY:
I know how you feel.

3
00:00:03,393 --> 00:00:05,293
(Amy:)She didn't invite any of us.

4
00:00:05,295 --> 00:00:06,995
It was spur of the moment!

5
00:00:06,997 --> 00:00:09,867
(Bernadette:)But we did get to see a live
stream of it on the Internet.

6
00:00:09,866 --> 00:00:12,396
(Beverly:)I could've watched it
on the Internet?

7
00:00:13,970 --> 00:00:16,600
(Amy:)Thank you.

8
00:00:17,774 --> 00:00:20,444
(Penny:)So if we would have asked you
to come to Vegas

9
00:00:20,443 --> 00:00:22,813
(Penny:)to see us get married,
you would've come?

10
00:00:22,812 --> 00:00:25,782
(Beverly:)No, I would've said
you're making a huge mistake.

11
00:00:25,782 --> 00:00:28,712
(Beverly:)But an invitation
would've been nice.

12
00:00:28,718 --> 00:00:32,488
(Penny:)You really think
we made a mistake?

13
00:00:32,489 --> 00:00:34,119
(Beverly:)At the time I did.

14
00:00:34,124 --> 00:00:36,494
But I-I've never seen
Leonard so happy,

15
00:00:36,493 --> 00:00:39,263
(Beverly:)so... perhaps I was wrong.

16
00:00:39,262 --> 00:00:41,362
(Penny:)Wow.

17
00:00:41,364 --> 00:00:43,364
(Penny:)Okay.

18
00:00:43,366 --> 00:00:45,266
(Penny:)Well, um, how about this?

19
00:00:45,268 --> 00:00:46,768
(Penny:)Maybe while
you're still in town,

20
00:00:46,770 --> 00:00:49,670
(Penny:)Leonard and I could have
another small ceremony.

21
00:00:49,673 --> 00:00:51,903
(Penny:)You know, if you're interested.

22
00:00:51,908 --> 00:00:55,508
(Beverly:)I would find that
perfectly acceptable.

23
00:00:55,512 --> 00:00:57,412
(gasps) She would find it

24
00:00:57,414 --> 00:00:58,814
perfectly acceptable!

25
00:00:58,815 --> 00:01:01,015
You guys saw it! We bonded!

26
00:01:10,038 --> 00:01:11,308
(Bernadette:)Howie?

27
00:01:11,306 --> 00:01:13,336
(Bernadette:)You doing okay?
You've been in there a while.

28
00:01:13,341 --> 00:01:15,571
WOLOWITZ: (stammers)
I'm fine. Be right out.

29
00:01:17,712 --> 00:01:20,682
(Howard(through bathroom door):)Am I an American hero?
(chuckles)

30
00:01:22,250 --> 00:01:25,080
(Sheldon:)Well, that's
a good question, Jim.

31
00:01:25,086 --> 00:01:28,986
(Howard(through bathroom door):)Don't you think once
an astronaut leaves the planet,

32
00:01:28,990 --> 00:01:32,360
(Howard(through bathroom door):)he's a hero to all the nations
of the Earth?

33
00:01:32,360 --> 00:01:35,830
(toilet flushes)

34
00:01:35,830 --> 00:01:37,530
(Howard(through bathroom door):)Okey dokey.

35
00:01:37,532 --> 00:01:39,172
(Howard(through bathroom door):)I think I have time
for one more question.

